The `with` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`, so I left out the enrichment fetch. Calling `http-client` would need a grant this node doesn't have, and sending `tick.reason` to an external host is a data egress path the graph didn't authorize. The `StartRun` body below uses only the clock.

